Package: luci-app-multikmwan
Version: 1.0.0-1
Depends: luci-base, curl
Section: luci
Category: LuCI
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 0
Maintainer: David
Description: MultiKmwan - LuCI front-end for GL.iNet kmwan.
 Switch kmwan between failover and load-balance, tune per-WAN priority
 and load ratio, assign individual LAN clients to a preferred WAN via
 policy routing, and rank WANs by measured download/upload speed.
